    # NOTE: Non-standard but if the supplied mime type is undefined, we use computed mime type's default value.
    return

## Ported from Libraries/LibWeb/MimeSniff/Resource.cpp:627 Web::MimeSniff::Resource::rules_for_sniffing_fonts_specifically.
